1. Amazon RDS — As written in your record
Aim: To create an Amazon RDS database instance.
Procedure
1. Open AWS Management Console.
2. Open RDS Dashboard.
3. Select Database Creation Method.
4. Select Database Engine.
5. Select a Template.
6. Enter Database Identification.
7. Configure Instance.
8. Configure Storage.
9. Configure Connectivity.
10. Additional Configuration.
11. Review the configuration.
12. Create the Database.
13. Get the Database Endpoint.
14. Verify the Database.
Cloud RDS structure:
MySQL Database (Instance)
          ↓
    Amazon RDS
          ↓
    AWS Cloud
          ↓
     Database


Simple steps to remember:

AWS → RDS → Create Database → MySQL → Free Tier → Settings → Storage → Connectivity → Create → Available → Endpoint

